# #832/#913 PR8: the on-device output-safety classifier is COMMITTED (founder
# decision: embed, never download). Re-include this one .mlpackage + its inner
# model.mlmodel / weight.bin, overriding the broad model globs above. Largest
# inner file is ~43 MB (< GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit), so normal git.
!Sources/EnviousWisprLLM/Resources/OutputClassifier.mlpackage/
!Sources/EnviousWisprLLM/Resources/OutputClassifier.mlpackage/**

# #1224 (#1543: relocated to the app target when audio capture came in-process):
# the bundled Silero VAD model is COMMITTED (embed, never download — same
# rationale as the classifier above). Re-include this one .mlmodelc + its inner
# coremldata.bin / weights/weight.bin, overriding the broad *.bin glob above.
# Whole asset is ~1 MB.
!Sources/EnviousWispr/Resources/VAD/silero-vad-unified-256ms-v6.0.0.mlmodelc/
!Sources/EnviousWispr/Resources/VAD/silero-vad-unified-256ms-v6.0.0.mlmodelc/**

